WEBVTT

00:05:28.196 --> 00:05:30.196
So it would choose one at random and say,

00:05:30.196 --> 00:05:31.676
this is your plan for tonight.

00:05:31.716 --> 00:05:33.076
And so I ended up showing --

00:05:33.116 --> 00:05:39.396
(Laughter)

00:05:39.436 --> 00:05:42.916
And so I'd show up
at events like Joe's birthday,

00:05:42.956 --> 00:05:46.676
the eighth grade band recital,
chess club, truck drivers school.

00:05:47.636 --> 00:05:49.036
And it was really interesting

00:05:49.036 --> 00:05:52.156
because these were communities
that I knew nothing about

00:05:52.196 --> 00:05:54.396
but were having amazing events

00:05:54.396 --> 00:05:56.476
to talk about things
that they cared about.

00:05:56.516 --> 00:05:59.236
And there I was.